{"unit_id":"AFAP__dsh-input-file-ref#card-zh","repo":"AFAP/dsh-input-file-ref","commit":"c9b084d0776b84c8ba6da50613ac5a3ccd0bf223","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-input-file-ref 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的输入框文件引用插件。它把文件选择面板接入会话输入框的 @ 触发入口，并由主机端接口提供当前会话工作目录的文件列表。用户可以逐级浏览目录、递归搜索文件、查看相对路径和大小，并将选中的路径以可编辑的 @相对路径形式回填到输入框。适合在编写提示时引用项目文件；需要 DSH web 会话已有工作目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:3-19","lib/index.js:387-480"]}
{"unit_id":"AFAP__dsh-input-file-ref#card-en","repo":"AFAP/dsh-input-file-ref","commit":"c9b084d0776b84c8ba6da50613ac5a3ccd0bf223","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-input-file-ref adds an @ file picker to the DSH web composer. Browse the session working directory or search it recursively, then insert a selected relative path into the prompt. Requires a DSH web session with a working directory.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:3-19","lib/index.js:387-480"]}
